  "description": "A C# game engine and scene editor for the browser via Blazor WebAssembly and WebGPU. Includes scene graph, transform hierarchy, orbit/FPS cameras, translate/rotate/scale gizmos, point lights, procedural sky, collision/gravity/jumping, mesh loading (OBJ/GLB/STL) with automatic LOD generation, skeletal animation (rigged GLB with joint skinning and keyframe playback), per-object scripting, 13 gameplay tags, undo/redo, scene serialization, and batched instanced rendering.",
